WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0103: a city is drawn whole under the see-through's camera.
A playtest outside in Orgrimmar: "buildings get cut in half", "ground is seethrough and building up above are all
cut". The portal walk chooses a WMO's groups from where the eye is, and world mode's eye stands anywhere, inside
rock too since 0097, so a city lost whole groups in straight edges and its buried terrain showed. Wider than a house,
every group is drawn while the see-through is live.
